": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Inrain+Grow", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Inrain+Grow&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2026 Music From Memory"]}, {"t": 6120, "time": "01:42:00", "artist": "Annex 4", "title": "Micromega", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Annex+4+Micromega", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Annex+4+Micromega&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“The track underneath me at the moment is Micromega by Annex 4.”", "the audio briefly looked like James Asher - On the First Rays, but the presenter said otherwise"]}, {"t": 6298, "time": "01:44:58", "artist": "DJ Ojo", "title": "Cloud Stuck", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=DJ+Ojo+Cloud+Stuck&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“The track underneath me at the moment is Cloud Stuck by DJ Ojo.”"]}], "counts": {"high": 4, "mid": 10, "low": 4}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:05:01", "end": "00:06:09", "text": "Hello, you're listening to Limbs Akimbo on FBi Radio, with me, Killian, covering today. Before we go any further, I'd like to take a moment to acknowledge that we're broadcasting on Gadigal land this morning. Sovereignty was never ceded. This is, was, and always will be Aboriginal land. And underneath me at the moment is a new one off Sydney Label Theory Therapy. It's from Alien D. It's called Equinox Cherry. And above that, we had Crop Classifier. It's a bit of a tongue twister by Thomas Bush. And I'm going to keep it nice and soft and dubby as we ease into the morning. I've got two hours together. I hope you enjoy. And if you want to say hello, you can text on 0435 123 945."}, {"start": "00:43:54", "end": "00:44:10", "text": "Hello, you're listening to Limbs Akimbo on FBi Radio. Underneath me at the moment is one from Chris Carter. It's called Pantavisk. I have a record called Disobedient. It's so cool."}, {"start": "01:10:04", "end": "01:11:22", "text": "Hello. You're listening to M5 on FBi Radio. Not M5, we're listening to Limbs Akimbo. It's the other show. It's got some really nice texts in. One from Tom in Maroubra says, this dub vibe perfectly reflects my mood on this damp morning, but with Move By Way Festival on this afternoon. hope you have the best afternoon Tom so nice to hear and also another one from Ivy says loving the mix super nice underneath me at the moment is Looking Glass by Kay Water above that we had a new one from Wael Hui I've played a bit of Wael Hui today I'm a bit of a fan and at the top there we had one from sea feel which was more like space gonna keep going with this w vibe i think people are enjoying it on this gloomy day might round it out with some new post-rocky things we'll see how we feel but so nice to hear from you and you can keep texting in on 0435 123 945 this is limbs akimbo"}, {"start": "01:43:18", "end": "01:43:53", "text": "Hello, you're listening to Limbs Akimbo on FBi Radio with me, Lily, today, or Killian. The track underneath me at the moment is Micromega by Annex 4. I'm going to keep it dubbed out and moody because it's such a nice rainy morning. And I hope you're having a really lovely start to the day. Let me know what you're up to this afternoon or what you're planning to make for lunch. You can text in on 0435 123 945."}, {"start": "01:50:08", "end": "01:50:35", "text": "Hello, you've been listening to Limbs Akimbo on FBi Radio with me, Lily. The track underneath me at the moment is Cloud Stuck by DJ Ojo. And thanks for staying with me. This is my last ten minutes. It's been really nice. Any last minute texts, you can reach me on 0435 123 945."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Crop Classifier", "artists": [{"name": "Thomas Bush"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:07"}, "track": {"title": "Equinox Cherry", "artists": [{"name": "Alien D"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:06:42"}, "track": {"title": "A.25", "artists": [{"name": "In Transit"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:15:32"}, "track": {"title": "Just An Illusion", "artists": [{"name": "Imagination"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:17:46"}, "track": {"title": "The wind at night", "artists": [{"name": "Pablo's Eye"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:23:00"}, "track": {"title": "Vatherfenslau (feat. Carlos Perón) [Resident DJ Of Dorian Grey feat. Carlos Perón - Volume One - Excerpt]", "artists": [{"name"